dot/pull/105342#issuecomment-2837692110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105342","id":2837692110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pI77O","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T06:57:29Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T06:57:29Z","body":"Renamed `EditorTextureImportPlugin` to `EditorTexturePostImportPlugin`. For me it seems more similar to PostImportPlugin rather than EditorImportPlugin.\r\n\r\nThis PR has limitations. If you want to import custom resource that contains ctex, it is still only possible to use `EditorImportPlugin` and `PortableCompressedTexture2D`.\r\n\r\nLet me know if this design is reasonable, or if there is a better way to extend texture importer.  ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2837692110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2961494690","html_u